<div class="robolink-step ">

		<div class="robolink-step-head"><span>Step 1</span></div>
	
			<h2>Build the backbone</h2>
	
	
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<ol>
<li>Make a T-bar by bolting two long L-frames to either side of a 10-hole metal frame. Make sure to use two bolts for this!</li>
<li>Bolt another 10-hole metal frame to the original 10-hole metal frame. They should be overlapping so that there are three holes left at the top.</li>
<li>Repeat step 2, but make sure to use two bolts that are one hole apart from each other!</li>
</ol>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element">
		
