<div class="robolink-step ">

		<div class="robolink-step-head"><span>Step 2</span></div>
	
			<h2>Build the base</h2>
	
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p>For this entire step, pay attention to the orientation of the blueboards and the placement of parts!</p>
<ol>
<li>Bolt the blueboards together with a 4-hole metal frame. 2 holes should be on each blueboard.</li>
<li>Bolt two short L-frames to the top of the right blueboard. The ends that are sticking up should be facing away from the center of the blueboard.</li>
<li>Use eight short standoffs to make four sets of stacked standoffs.</li>
<li>Put each stacked standoff at a corner of the joined blueboards.</li>
</ol>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element">
		
