</div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><a id="6a22165636088" name="6a22165636088" class="scroll-spy-anchor"></a>
<div class="robolink-step ">

		<div class="robolink-step-head"><span>Step 4</span></div>
	
			<h2>Connect the motor</h2>
	
	
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<ol>
<li>Bolt two long L-frames to the motor. Make sure the wheel hub is at the bottom of the motor!</li>
<li>Bolt the long L-frames to the top of the bot&#8217;s backbone.</li>
</ol>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="694" height="393" src="https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Viking-Ship-Bot-Motor1-694x393.jpg" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-large" alt="Viking Ship Bot Motor1" title="Viking Ship Bot Motor1" srcset="https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Viking-Ship-Bot-Motor1.jpg 694w, https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Viking-Ship-Bot-Motor1-300x170.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 694px) 100vw, 694px" /></div>
