</div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><a id="6a2216563a5d3" name="6a2216563a5d3" class="scroll-spy-anchor"></a>
<div class="robolink-step ">

		<div class="robolink-step-head"><span>Step 8</span></div>
	
			<h2>Build the hinge</h2>
	
	
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<ol>
<li>Position a horn bracket so there&#8217;s a hole at the top.</li>
<li>Bolt a 10-hole metal frame to the second hole from the top on the right, and then repeat with another 10-hole metal frame with the second hole from the top on the left.</li>
<li>Join the two 10-hole metal frames with a bolt. You may need to move the 10-hole metal frames a little to do this.</li>
</ol>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="992" height="462" src="https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Viking-Ship-Bot-Hinge-992x462.png" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-large" alt="Viking Ship Bot Hinge" title="Viking Ship Bot Hinge" srcset="https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Viking-Ship-Bot-Hinge.png 992w, https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Viking-Ship-Bot-Hinge-300x140.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 992px) 100vw, 992px" /></div>
		</figure>
	</div>
</div>
</div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><a id="6a2216563b196" name="6a2216563b196" class="scroll-spy-anchor"></a>
<div class="robolink-step ">

		<div class="robolink-step-head"><span>Step 9</span></div>
	
			<h2>Finish building the Viking ship deck</h2>
	
	
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<ol>
<li>Attach a long L-frame to each blueboard of the Viking ship deck. They should be next to the short standoffs at the bottom of the blueboards, and the ends that are sticking up should be facing away from the center of the blueboards.</li>
</ol>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="992" height="463" src="https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Viking-Ship-Deck2-992x463.png" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-large" alt="Viking Ship Deck2" title="Viking Ship Deck2" srcset="https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Viking-Ship-Deck2.png 992w, https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Viking-Ship-Deck2-300x140.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 992px) 100vw, 992px" /></div>
		</figure>
	</div>
</div>
</div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><a id="6a2216563bce9" name="6a2216563bce9" class="scroll-spy-anchor"></a>
<div class="robolink-step ">

		<div class="robolink-step-head"><span>Step 10</span></div>
	
			<h2>Connect the hinge and deck</h2>
	
	
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<ol>
<li>Bolt the 10-hole metal frames on the hinge to the long L-frames so that there is some overlap. Use two bolts on each side to do this! Your decks should be at an angle.</li>
</ol>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="690" height="991" src="https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Viking-Ship-HingeDeck-690x991.png" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-large" alt="Viking Ship Hinge&amp;Deck" title="Viking Ship Hinge&amp;Deck" srcset="https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Viking-Ship-HingeDeck.png 690w, https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Viking-Ship-HingeDeck-209x300.png 209w" sizes="(max-width: 690px) 100vw, 690px" /></div>
		</figure>
	</div>
</div>
</div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><a id="6a2216563c80b" name="6a2216563c80b" class="scroll-spy-anchor"></a>
<div class="robolink-step ">

		<div class="robolink-step-head"><span>Step 11</span></div>
	
			<h2>Connect to the motor</h2>
	
	
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<ol>
<li>Use a black screw to attach the horn bracket to the motor.</li>
</ol>

		</div>
	</div>

	<div  class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey"><img decoding="async" width="692" height="991" src="https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Viking-Ship-Bot-motor-692x991.png" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-large" alt="Viking Ship Bot motor" title="Viking Ship Bot motor" srcset="https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Viking-Ship-Bot-motor.png 692w, https://archive.learn.robolink.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/Viking-Ship-Bot-motor-209x300.png 209w" sizes="(max-width: 692px) 100vw, 692px" /></div>
